The best thing to do (that I do, games are important you know) is to edit
the path statement in your autoexec.bat file to include your nethack directory
and the problem will disappear. I use

path c:\dos;c:\nethack;c:\windows;c:\bin

and I can run it from windows or from any directory on the disk.


